OL,3,GNEWSAWarning after man who smoked in
OL,4,Abed died in fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coroner has warned better fire-risk
OL,7,Falerts are needed after a pensioner who
OL,8,Fdied in a blaze was prescribed a
OL,9,Fflammable ointment despite smoking in
OL,10,Fbed.
OL,12,FMalcolm Campbell died on 15 January at
OL,13,FSouth Tyneside District General
OL,14,FHospital from the effects of smoke
OL,15,Finhalation a day after a fire broke out
OL,16,Fat his home in South Shields.
OL,18,FThe 84-year-old who was diagnosed with
OL,19,Fdementia in May 2022 regularly smoked
OL,20,Fin bed and was identified as at risk by
OL,21,Fhis carers, GP and other visiting
OL,22,Fprofessionals.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
