OL,3,GNEWSAWarning after man who smoked in
OL,4,Abed died in fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FAssistant coroner for Gateshead and
OL,7,FSouth Tyneside, James Thompson, wrote
OL,8,Fto the Department of Health and Social
OL,9,FCare (DHSC) with concerns after
OL,10,FCampbell was prescribed a flammable
OL,11,Fcream.
